---
import '../styles/global.css' 
import Header from '../components/header.astro'
---



<body class="m-0 bg-[url('billeder/rulle.png')] bg-cover bg-fixed">
    <Header/>
    

    <div class="grid grid-cols-4 grid-rows-70 p-5">
        
        <!-- slot emoji -->
        <p class="row-start-2 col-start-2 text-[60px] place-self-center">
            &#x1F3F0; 
        </p>

        <div class="row-start-3 col-start-2 row-span-3">
            <img class="w-full" src="/billeder/citybranding/gGif.gif">
        </div>
        <div class=" row-start-4 col-start-1 row-span-5">
            <img class="w-full" src="/billeder/citybranding/daller.png">
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-3 col-start-3 row-span-5">
            <img class="w-full" src="/billeder/citybranding/daller2.png">
        </div>
        <div class=" row-start-2 col-start-1 row-span-2 place-self-center">
            <img class="w-30" src="/billeder/citybranding/ornament.png">
        </div>

    
        <div class="row-start-6 col-start-2 col-span-2 ">
            <p class="font-serif text-black text-[80px]">
                im not
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-7 col-start-1 col-span-3 place-self-center">
            <p class="font-serif text-black text-[80px]">
                coming to
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-8 col-start-1 col-span-4">
            <img src="/billeder/citybranding/GLASGOW.png" class="w-170 pl-10 pt-5">
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-9 col-start-2">
			<img src="http://dl.glitter-graphics.net/pub/621/621641xy2arhaa2t.gif" width=300 height=111>
        </div>

        <div class="z-10 row-start-10 col-start-1 col-span-3 row-span-4">
            <p class="font-serif text-pink-600 text-[40px] pl-8">
                my most researched project. 
                <br> listened to <span class="font-bold italic">"Glasgow"</span> by Jockstrap all day every day for two weeks (thereof the project title).
                <br>
                <br> the song was so inspiring to me, that i wanted to encapture the feeling of the song, in the <span class="font-bold">dynamic visual identity</span> for the city of glasgow.
            </p>
        </div>


        <!-- swag girl -->
        <div class="row-start-14 col-start-1 row-span-4 pt-8">
            <img class="w-70" src="http://dl8.glitter-graphics.net/pub/1628/1628328f6ki3obe7m.gif" width=61 height=145>
        </div>

        <div class="row-start-14 col-start-2 col-span-3 row-span-3 pl-8">
            <p class="font-serif italic text-[95px] text-blue-600">
                <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white">presenting: </span>
                <br>the dynamic visual identity 
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="row-start-18 col-start-3 row-span-4 col-span-2 place-items-center pt-12">
            <img src="/billeder/citybranding/inspo.gif" class="w-full border-8 border-blue-600">
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-17 col-start-2 col-span-2 place-self-center">
            <p class="font-serif text-blue-600 text-[60px]">
                the inspo :
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-18 col-start-1 col-span-2 row-span-5">
            <p class="font-serif text-blue-600 text-[40px] pr-10 text-right hyphens-auto" lang="en">
                very medieval, very pink, very raw & beautifully ornamented.
                <br> 
                <br> i like how gray and industrial glasgow looks from the outside, contrasting the stunning gothic architechture.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="row-start-22 col-start-2 col-span-2 place-self-center">
            <p class="font-serif text-blue-600 text-[60px]">
                the results :
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="row-start-23 col-start-1 col-span-2 row-span-2">
            <img src="/billeder/citybranding/grid2.jpg">
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-23 col-start-3 col-span-2 row-span-2">
            <img src="/billeder/citybranding/glasSort.png">
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-25 col-start-1 col-span-2 row-span-2">
            <img src="/billeder/citybranding/glasGray.png">
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-25 col-start-3 col-span-2 row-span-2">
            <img src="/billeder/citybranding/glasPink.png">
        </div>

        <div class="row-start-27 col-start-1 col-span-3 row-span-4">
            <p class="font-serif text-blue-600 text-[40px] hyphens-auto" lang="en">
                the pattern is based off gothic ornaments I noticed while strolling through the city on google maps.
                <br> some of the shapes are traced from the font <span class="font-bold italic">"Flor De Ruina"</span> designed by Felipe Sanzana. 
                <br>
                <br> i placed the individual shapes in a grid, according to the principle of a recursive algorithm.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="row-start-31 col-start-1 col-span-2 row-span-3">
            <img src="/billeder/citybranding/traceA.png">
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-33 col-start-2 col-span-2 row-span-4 pt-10">
            <img src="/billeder/citybranding/traceG.png">
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-31 col-start-3 col-span-1 row-span-2">
            <img src="/billeder/citybranding/FlorDeRuina.png">
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-33 col-start-1 col-span-1 row-span-2 pt-10">
            <img src="/billeder/citybranding/MOENSTRE.png">
        </div>

        <div class="row-start-36 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-2">
            <p class="font-serif italic text-[95px] text-blue-600">
                then I romantized everything & did this
            </p>
        </div>
        <!-- swag girl 2 -->
        <div class="row-start-38 col-start-4 col-span-1 row-span-5">
            <img class="w-full" src="http://dl.glitter-graphics.net/pub/55/55951lp3buav067.gif" width=45 height=140>
        </div>

        <div class="row-start-38 col-start-1 col-span-3 row-span-4">
            <img src="/billeder/citybranding/building-wall.png">
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-42 col-start-1 col-span-3 row-span-4">
            <img src="/billeder/citybranding/cykel.png">
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-46 col-start-1 col-span-3 row-span-4">
            <img src="/billeder/citybranding/galleri.png">
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-50 col-start-1 col-span-3 row-span-7">
            <img src="/billeder/citybranding/fsf.jpg">
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-57 col-start-3 col-span-2 row-span-8">
            <img src="/billeder/citybranding/banner.png">
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-57 col-start-1 col-span-2 row-span-6">
            <p class="font-serif text-[40px] text-blue-600 hyphens-auto pr-5" lang="en">
                this is when I started incorporating the song lyrics into the branding.
                <br> 
                <br> I found it funny that the protagonist doesn't want to go to glasgow.
                <br> 
                <br> I decided to use that as a bait to make people actually want to go to glasgow.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-62 col-start-1 col-span-1 row-span-2 place-self-center">
            <img src="/billeder/citybranding/klistermaerke.png" class="w-50">
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-62 col-start-2 col-span-1 row-span-2 place-self-center">
            <img src="/billeder/citybranding/klistermaerke2.png" class="w-50">
        </div>

        <div class="row-start-65 col-start-1 col-span-4 row-span-2">
            <p class="font-serif italic text-[95px] text-blue-600">
                main takeaways
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="row-start-66 col-start-1 col-span-3 row-span-6">
            <p class="font-serif text-[40px] text-blue-600 hyphens-auto" lang="en">
                glasgow is not a popular city to visit. 
                <br> it's raw culture, financial instability & socioeconomic inequality is very visible.
                <br> BUT!
                <br> youth culture, & the persistence of the people, is coloring the ever so crusty brick walls - a huge inspiration to me!
                <br>
                <br> I can't lie, I'm coming to glasgow. ;)
            </p>
        </div>




        
    </div>

</body>
